---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import SocialLinks from '../components/SocialLinks.astro';
import TocSidebar from '../components/TocSidebar.astro';
import { LICENSE, SITE, SOCIALS } from '../config';

const email = SOCIALS.find((s) => s.id === 'email')?.href ?? '';

const tocHeadings = [
	{ depth: 2, text: 'About Me', id: 'about-me' },
	{ depth: 2, text: 'Toolbox', id: 'toolbox' },
	{ depth: 2, text: 'About This Site', id: 'site' },
	{ depth: 2, text: 'Copyright', id: 'copyright' },
	{ depth: 2, text: 'Privacy', id: 'privacy' },
];
---

<Layout title="About - Rito-492">
	<!-- 文章式排版：与博客正文一致，右栏目录定位 -->
	<article class="about-content">
		<header class="about-header">
			<h1>About</h1>
			<p class="subtitle">A bit about me, this site, and how to reach me.</p>
		</header>

		<section class="about-section">
			<h2 id="about-me">About Me</h2>
			<p>你好，我是 Rito-492，吉林大学 2023 级本科生，软件工程专业。</p>
			<p>
				平时主要写 Python 和 C++，折腾深度学习、Linux
				和各类工具；也会把保研、夏令营这类经历整理成文字。
			</p>
			<p>这个博客是代码与思考的自留地——把学过的东西写清楚，把没想明白的事情慢慢想明白。</p>
			<div class="about-contact">
				<span class="contact-label">Contact</span>
				<SocialLinks variant="row" ids={['github', 'email', 'steam']} />
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="about-section">
			<h2 id="toolbox">Toolbox</h2>
			<div class="tools-grid">
				<div class="tool-group">
					<span class="tool-label">Languages</span>
					<div class="tool-tags">
						<span class="tech-tag">Python</span>
						<span class="tech-tag">C++</span>
						<span class="tech-tag">Java</span>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="tool-group">
					<span class="tool-label">Deep Learning</span>
					<div class="tool-tags">
						<span class="tech-tag">PyTorch</span>
						<span class="tech-tag">KAN</span>
						<span class="tech-tag">Diffusion</span>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="tool-group">
					<span class="tool-label">Tools</span>
					<div class="tool-tags">
						<span class="tech-tag">Linux</span>
						<span class="tech-tag">WSL2</span>
						<span class="tech-tag">Arch</span>
						<span class="tech-tag">Git</span>
						<span class="tech-tag">Docker</span>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="about-section">
			<h2 id="site">About This Site</h2>
			<p>
				本站基于 Astro 构建，以静态方式部署于 GitHub Pages。评论由 Giscus 提供，访问统计使用
				GoatCounter，文章内容采用 {LICENSE.name} 许可协议。
			</p>
			<p class="site-credits">
				图标来自{' '}
				<a
					class="text-link"
					href="https://lucide.dev"
					target="_blank"
					rel="noopener noreferrer"
				>
					Lucide
				</a>
				，字体为
				<a
					class="text-link"
					href="https://www.jetbrains.com/lp/mono/"
					target="_blank"
					rel="noopener noreferrer"
				>
					JetBrains Mono
				</a>
				与
				<a
					class="text-link"
					href="https://github.com/lxgw/LxgwWenKai"
					target="_blank"
					rel="noopener noreferrer"
				>
					霞鹜文楷
				</a>
				。
			</p>
			<div class="site-links">
				<a href={SITE.repo} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
					Source Code
				</a>
				<a href="/rss.xml">RSS</a>
				<a href={LICENSE.deedUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
					{LICENSE.name}
				</a>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="about-section">
			<h2 id="copyright">Copyright</h2>
			<p>
				本站原创文字与设计，除特别注明外，均采用
				<a
					class="text-link"
					href={LICENSE.deedUrl}
					target="_blank"
					rel="noopener noreferrer"
				>
					{LICENSE.name}
				</a>
				国际许可协议授权。
			</p>
			<p>您可以自由复制、分享，并基于本站内容进行创作，但须遵守以下条件：</p>
			<ul class="license-list">
				<li>
					<strong>署名</strong>：注明作者 Rito-492 及原文链接；
				</li>
				<li>
					<strong>非商业性使用</strong>：不得将内容用于商业目的；
				</li>
				<li>
					<strong>相同方式共享</strong>：改编作品须以相同协议发布。
				</li>
			</ul>
			<p>
				站内引用的第三方图片、商标与素材，版权归各自权利人所有；如存在侵权内容，请通过
				<a class="text-link" href={email}>
					Email
				</a>
				联系删除。商业转载或批量使用请先联系作者。
			</p>
		</section>

		<section class="about-section">
			<h2 id="privacy">Privacy</h2>
			<p>
				本站使用 GoatCounter
				进行访问统计，仅记录聚合数据（页面路径、来源、浏览器与地区），不设置跟踪
				Cookie，也不采集个人身份信息。文章页显示的浏览数与访问人数就是这份按路径聚合的计数，与访客个人无关。
			</p>
			<p>
				评论区由 Giscus 提供，需要 GitHub 账号登录；评论内容存储在该仓库的 GitHub
				Discussions 中，并遵循 GitHub 的隐私政策。
			</p>
		</section>
	</article>

	<!-- 右栏：本页目录 -->
	<Fragment slot="right">
		<TocSidebar postTitle="Contents" tocHeadings={tocHeadings} />
	</Fragment>
</Layout>

<style>
	/* About 采用文章式排版：无卡片边框，靠标题层级与段间距组织内容 */
	.about-header {
		margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
	}

	.about-header h1 {
		font-size: 2rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: -0.02em;
		margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
	}

	.about-header .subtitle {
		color: var(--color-text-muted);
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		margin: 0;
	}

	.about-section + .about-section {
		margin-top: 3rem;
	}

	.about-section h2 {
		font-size: 1.35rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		color: var(--color-text);
		margin: 0 0 1rem;
		scroll-margin-top: 5rem;
	}

	.about-section p {
		color: var(--color-text);
		line-height: 1.85;
		margin: 0 0 1rem;
	}

	.about-section p:last-child {
		margin-bottom: 0;
	}

	.about-contact {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 0.75rem;
		margin-top: 1.5rem;
	}

	.contact-label {
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		color: var(--color-text-muted);
	}

	.tools-grid {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0.9rem;
	}

	.tool-group {
		display: flex;
		align-items: baseline;
		gap: 0.75rem;
	}

	.tool-label {
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		font-weight: 500;
		color: var(--color-text-muted);
		min-width: 90px;
		flex-shrink: 0;
	}

	.tool-tags {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 0.4rem;
	}

	.site-credits {
		color: var(--color-text-muted);
		font-size: 0.9rem;
	}

	.site-links {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 1.25rem;
		margin-top: 1.25rem;
	}

	.site-links a {
		color: var(--color-primary);
		font-size: 0.88rem;
		text-decoration: none;
	}

	.site-links a:hover {
		text-decoration: underline;
		text-underline-offset: 3px;
	}

	.license-list {
		margin: 0 0 1rem;
		padding-left: 1.25rem;
		line-height: 1.85;
	}

	.license-list li {
		margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
	}

	.license-list li:last-child {
		margin-bottom: 0;
	}

	.license-list strong {
		color: var(--color-text);
		font-weight: 600;
	}

	.text-link {
		color: var(--color-primary);
		text-decoration: none;
	}

	.text-link:hover {
		text-decoration: underline;
		text-underline-offset: 3px;
	}

	@media (max-width: 640px) {
		.about-header h1 {
			font-size: 1.75rem;
		}

		.tool-group {
			flex-direction: column;
			gap: 0.4rem;
		}

		.tool-label {
			min-width: 0;
		}
	}
</style>
